{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22629","headline":"晚秋有怀郑中旧隐 · 白居易","name":"晚秋有怀郑中旧隐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天高风嫋嫋，乡思绕关河。\n寥落归山梦，殷勤采蕨歌。\n病添心寂寞，愁人鬓蹉跎。\n晚树蝉鸣少，秋阶日上多。\n长闲羡云鹤，久别媿烟萝。\n其奈丹墀上，君恩未报何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22629.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22629","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}